Subject: [PATCH] cli: keep slow HTTP peers outside native tree ownership

Bound request and response buffering, preserve serialized native traversal,
and release every native/admission lock before writing to a slow peer.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [lab profiling adapter]

--- a/src/rdkb-cli/main.go
+++ b/src/rdkb-cli/main.go
@@ -3180,26 +3180,13 @@
 	fmt.Printf("📊 Dashboard: http://0.0.0.0:8888\n")
 	fmt.Printf("🔌 WebSocket: ws://0.0.0.0:8888/api/v1/ws\n")
 
-	log.Fatal(http.ListenAndServe("0.0.0.0:8888", router))
+	log.Fatal(labHTTPServer(router).ListenAndServe())
 }
 
